A roster of Malazan characters (Steven Erikson) sorted into the ROOT0 specialty
classes: wizards by color (White=healing, Black=destruction, Red=both,
Purple=all+shadow), Aristocrats (Quick Ben), Fixers (Kalam), Comedy Relief
(Gesler/Stormy & the marines), Shadow Games (Cotillion/Dancer, Shadowthrone),
Economic Stability (Tehol & Bugg), Undying Loyalty (Brys & Tehol's household),
and the Witness (Karsa Orlong). roster.json is the source of truth; the page
and README read from it. Characters referenced as inspiration only.
